ຈາກຕ່າງປະ ເທດ ທີ່ນອນຢູ່ໃນບັນຊີລາຍຊື່ຂອງປະເທດທີ່ເປັນສະມາຊິກຂອງ ອົງການຄຸ້ມຄອງວຽກງານຫຼັກຊັບສາກົນ
</span><span lang="PT-BR" style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:" phetsarath="" ot";="" mso-fareast-font-family:calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:="" pt-br"="">(Intrenational Organization of Securities Commission </span><span lang="LAO" style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:" phetsarath="" ot";mso-fareast-font-family:="" calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:pt-br;mso-bidi-language:="" lao"="">ຂຽນຫຍໍ້ </span><span lang="PT-BR" style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:" phetsarath="" ot";="" mso-fareast-font-family:calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:="" pt-br"="">IOSCO)</span><span lang="LAO" style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:" phetsarath="" ot";="" mso-fareast-font-family:calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:="" pt-br;mso-bidi-language:lao"=""> ຫຼື ຂອງປະເທດທີ່ມີສາຍພົວພັນຮ່ວມມື
ໂດຍການເຊັນບົດບັນທຶກຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈຮ່ວມກັບ ອົງການຄຸ້ມຄອງວຽກງານຫຼັກຊັບຂອງ ສປປ ລາວ;</span><span lang="PT-BR" style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:" phetsarath="" ot";mso-fareast-font-family:="" calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:pt-br;mso-bidi-language:="" lao"=""><o:p></o:p></span></p>

